                                "sense_id": "84ae83c0-4ddd-386d-89a4-50a26827af9f",
                                "text": "But the truth was, her pantaloons came down to her ankles, and when she got the leg of one caught in a twig, she nearly fainted[.]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
